{"seq":1,"slug":"event-sourcing-concepts","title":"事件溯源核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/event-sourcing-cqrs/event-sourcing-fundamentals/event-sourcing-concepts","wordCount":1283,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件溯源核心概念\">事件溯源核心概念</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件溯源（Event Sourcing）是一种将系统所有状态变更以不可变事件序列的形式持久化的架构模式。与传统 CRUD 直接修改数据库中的当前状态不同，事件溯源记录的是&quot;发生了什么&quot;——每一个事件都是一条不可撤销的事实。当前状态不再直接存储，而是通过顺序重放事件序列计算得到。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统CRUD&#10;        A[用户操作] --&gt; B[更新当前状态]&#10;        B --&gt; C[旧状态被覆盖]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 事件溯源&#10;        D[用户操作] --&gt; E[追加事件]&#10;        E --&gt; F[事件流]&#10;        F --&gt; G[重放计算状态]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统CRUD\n        A[用户操作] --&gt; B[更新当前状态]\n        B --&gt; C[旧状态被覆盖]\n    end\n    subgraph 事件溯源\n        D[用户操作] --&gt; E[追加事件]\n        E --&gt; F[事件流]\n        F --&gt; G[重放计算状态]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 CRUD</th>\n<th>事件溯源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储内容</td>\n<td>当前状态快照</td>\n<td>完整事件序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写操作</td>\n<td>原地更新 / 删除</td>\n<td>仅追加写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史信息</td>\n<td>写入即丢失</td>\n<td>天然保留全部历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计能力</td>\n<td>需额外日志表</td>\n<td>内置审计追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态恢复</td>\n<td>依赖备份</td>\n<td>重放事件即可恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储增长</td>\n<td>相对稳定</td>\n<td>随事件累积增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种范式转变的核心思想是：数据的真相不是&quot;当前是什么&quot;，而是&quot;经历了什么&quot;。事件是系统中唯一的事实来源（Single Source of Truth），所有的读模型、投影、缓存都是从事件流派生出来的二级产物。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件即事实\">事件即事实</h2><p>在事件溯源中，事件是对已发生业务行为的不可变记录。一个设计良好的事件包含足够的上下文信息，使得任何消费者都能理解这个事实的完整含义。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DomainEvent {&#10;  readonly eventId: string;&#10;  readonly aggregateId: string;&#10;  readonly eventType: string;&#10;  readonly version: number;&#10;  readonly timestamp: Date;&#10;  readonly payload: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;  readonly metadata: EventMetadata;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface EventMetadata {&#10;  readonly correlationId: string;&#10;  readonly causationId: string;&#10;  readonly userId: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface OrderCreatedEvent extends DomainEvent {&#10;  readonly eventType: &#39;OrderCreated&#39;;&#10;  readonly payload: {&#10;    readonly customerId: string;&#10;    readonly items: ReadonlyArray&lt;OrderItem&gt;;&#10;    readonly totalAmount: number;&#10;    readonly currency: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> aggregateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventMetadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> correlationId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> causationId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderCreatedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> eventType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OrderCreated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> payload</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> totalAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>事件命名遵循过去时态的动词形式：<code>OrderCreated</code>、<code>PaymentProcessed</code>、<code>ItemShipped</code>。这强调了事件是已经完成的事实，而非正在执行的命令。事件一旦写入事件存储就不可修改——如果需要&quot;撤销&quot;某个操作，正确的做法是追加一个补偿事件（如 <code>OrderCancelled</code>），而不是删除原始事件。</p>\n<p>事件的不可变性带来了一个强大的特性：任何时刻的系统状态都可以通过从头重放事件序列精确还原。这意味着调试生产问题时，你可以在本地环境中重放相同的事件序列来复现完全相同的状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态重建\">状态重建</h2><p>聚合（Aggregate）是事件溯源中的核心构建块。每个聚合维护自己的事件流，通过将事件逐个应用到初始状态来重建当前状态。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class OrderAggregate {&#10;  private state: OrderState = { status: &#39;empty&#39;, items: [], total: 0 };&#10;  private version = 0;&#10;&#10;  static rehydrate(events: ReadonlyArray&lt;DomainEvent&gt;): OrderAggregate {&#10;    const aggregate = new OrderAggregate();&#10;    for (const event of events) {&#10;      aggregate.apply(event);&#10;    }&#10;    return aggregate;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private apply(event: DomainEvent): void {&#10;    switch (event.eventType) {&#10;      case &#39;OrderCreated&#39;:&#10;        this.state = {&#10;          status: &#39;created&#39;,&#10;          items: event.payload.items as ReadonlyArray&lt;OrderItem&gt;,&#10;          total: event.payload.totalAmount as number,&#10;        };&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;OrderConfirmed&#39;:&#10;        this.state = { ...this.state, status: &#39;confirmed&#39; };&#10;        break;&#10;      case &#39;OrderShipped&#39;:&#10;        this.state = { ...this.state, status: &#39;shipped&#39; };&#10;        break;&#10;    }&#10;    this.version = event.version;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  getState(): Readonly&lt;OrderState&gt; {&#10;    return this.state;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderAggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'empty'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, items: [], total: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  static</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rehydrate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DomainEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderAggregate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aggregate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A4