 participant Client&#10;    participant CommandHandler&#10;    participant Aggregate&#10;    participant EventStore&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;CommandHandler: CreateOrderCommand&#10;    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;EventStore: 加载事件流&#10;    EventStore--&gt;&gt;CommandHandler: 历史事件[]&#10;    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: rehydrate(events)&#10;    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: createOrder(command)&#10;    Aggregate-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: 验证业务规则&#10;    Aggregate-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: raiseEvent(OrderCreated)&#10;    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;EventStore: 追加新事件&#10;    EventStore--&gt;&gt;CommandHandler: 写入确认\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant CommandHandler\n    participant Aggregate\n    participant EventStore\n    Client-&gt;&gt;CommandHandler: CreateOrderCommand\n    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;EventStore: 加载事件流\n    EventStore--&gt;&gt;CommandHandler: 历史事件[]\n    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: rehydrate(events)\n    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: createOrder(command)\n    Aggregate-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: 验证业务规则\n    Aggregate-&gt;&gt;Aggregate: raiseEvent(OrderCreated)\n    CommandHandler-&gt;&gt;EventStore: 追加新事件\n    EventStore--&gt;&gt;CommandHandler: 写入确认</pre><p>聚合的设计原则是尽量小——只包含维护业务不变量所必需的数据。跨聚合的协调通过事件驱动的最终一致性来实现，而不是在单个事务中修改多个聚合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命令与事件的生命周期\">命令与事件的生命周期</h2><p>命令（Command）表达意图，事件（Event）记录事实。命令可能被拒绝（业务规则校验失败），但事件一旦产生就不可否认。这个区分是理解事件溯源的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Command {&#10;  readonly commandId: string;&#10;  readonly aggregateId: string;&#10;  readonly timestamp: Date;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CreateOrderCommand extends Command {&#10;  readonly customerId: string;&#10;  readonly items: ReadonlyArray&lt;OrderItem&gt;;&#10;  readonly currency: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type CommandResult = { success: true; events: ReadonlyArray&lt;DomainEvent&gt; } | { success: false; reason: string };&#10;&#10;const handleCommand = async (command: CreateOrderCommand, eventStore: EventStore): Promise&lt;CommandResult&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const events = await eventStore.loadStream(command.aggregateId);&#10;  const aggregate = OrderAggregate.rehydrate(events);&#10;  try {&#10;    aggregate.createOrder(command);&#10;    const newEvents = aggregate.getUncommittedEvents();&#10;    await eventStore.appendToStream(command.aggregateId, newEvents, aggregate.version);&#10;    return { success: true, events: newEvents };&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    return { success: false, reason: (error as Error).message };&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> commandId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> aggregateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span styl