tyle=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EventStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CommandResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> events</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(command.aggregateId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aggregate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OrderAggregate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rehydrate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(events);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    aggregate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(command);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> newEvents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aggregate.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUncommittedEvents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventStore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendToStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(command.aggregateId, newEvents, aggregate.version);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, events: newEvents };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).message };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>乐观并发控制是事件溯源中处理竞态条件的标准方式。写入事件时附带预期版本号，如果事件存储中的当前版本不匹配，说明有其他进程已经写入了新事件，此时写入操作失败，调用方需要重新加载并重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((事件溯源核心))&#10;    事件即事实&#10;      不可变记录&#10;      过去时态命名&#10;      补偿而非删除&#10;    状态重建&#10;      确定性重放&#10;      从初始状态累积&#10;      快照加速&#10;    聚合&#10;      一致性边界&#10;      独立事件流&#10;      业务规则守护&#10;    命令生命周期&#10;      命令表达意图&#10;      事件记录事实&#10;      乐观并发控制\">mindmap\n  root((事件溯源核心))\n    事件即事实\n      不可变记录\n      过去时态命名\n      补偿而非删除\n    状态重建\n      确定性重放\n      从初始状态累积\n      快照加速\n    聚合\n      一致性边界\n      独立事件流\n      业务规则守护\n    命令生命周期\n      命令表达意图\n      事件记录事实\n      乐观并发控制</pre><ul>\n<li>事件溯源将状态变更记录为不可变的事件序列，事件是系统中唯一的事实来源</li>\n<li>事件采用过去时态命名，一旦写入不可修改，&quot;撤销&quot;通过追加补偿事件实现</li>\n<li>当前状态通过顺序重放事件序列确定性地重建，同一事件序列始终产生相同状态</li>\n<li>聚合是一致性边界，每个聚合拥有独立事件流，通过业务规则验证来保护不变量</li>\n<li>命令表达操作意图（可被拒绝），事件记录已发生的事实（不可否认）</li>\n<li>乐观并发控制通过版本号检查解决多进程竞态写入问题</li>\n<li>相比 CRUD，事件溯源天然支持审计追踪、时间旅行查询和完整历史回溯，但引入了更高的系统复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事件溯源核心概念","id":"事件溯源核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事件即事实","id":"事件即事实"},{"level":2,"text":"状态重建","id":"状态重建"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合与事件流","id":"聚合与事件流"},{"level":2,"text":"命令与事件的生命周期","id":"命令与事件的生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"事件存储设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/event-sourcing-cqrs/event-sourcing-fundamentals/event-store-design"}}